      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Virginia?",
      "a": "Virginia has $3B in federal contract obligations for FY2027 to date. Historical annual obligations were $91.7B in FY22, $109B in FY23, $113B in FY24, $124B in FY25, and $126B in FY26. The current-year total is partial and reflects fiscal year to date activity."
